the problem with being a hero is you  have to be willing to die for what you  believe in hey titanfall 2 it's a thing  and a teaser trailer today was short but  included some key plot details here's  what you might have missed the crash  lifeboat has the name James Macallan on  the front mcallen was a lead character  in titanfall one first seen at this set  of gravestones on the colony map and  last seen sacrificing his life to  overload a reactor and crippled the IMC  fleet he's a turncoat who led a mutiny  15 years before titanfall one and was  the executive officer on an imc ship  called the Odyssey that ship was sent by  the IMC on a peacekeeping mission into  the frontier but started oppressing  civilians instead of protecting them  that means that this shot is likely a  flashback or possibly hints that  titanfall 2 is a prequel since the only  time an escape pod would have McAllen's  name on it is one who was the XO of the  Odyssey the Titan that steps in the  frame has the same toes and backward  bending knee joint as a Strider which is  a light Recon variant and makes sense if  somebody was coming to investigate a  crash only this Strider seems to have a  little bit more armor so it might be a  new class of Titan in between a Strider  and an atlas it has an unfamiliar logo  on the left leg all of which points to  this being the moment of contact when  Macallan met a ragtag group of rebelling  frontier citizens and organize them into  the militia of titanfall one  the next thing you should take note of  is the sword not only is there a sword  probably in game in titanfall too but  there's two pieces of information on the  blade we can only speculate about the  meaning though first up are the words  EHR titanium series there are a number  of manufacturers in the titanfall  universe including the most infamous ham  and robotics so this might be a new  player on the scene next is a serial  number reddit is hard at work on this  one but it appears to contain the 